# The generated purge SQL is NOT committed.
#
# ROUND 93 ruled that it can never run: this database is WORM and refuses DELETE on financial
# rows by design (db/migrations/202612220000_worm_financial_tables_no_delete.sql). The
# operation is a MASS VOID, not a purge.
#
# Committing it also broke every seat: verify-no-hard-delete-document-number-tables scans
# scripts/**/*.sql for DELETE FROM on any document-number table, and correctly refused it,
# failing every backend, frontend and migration push repo-wide. That guard is right and stays.
#
# The classification and the generator remain. If the post-void scaffolding cleanup is ever
# needed, regenerate it OUTSIDE the repo:
#   node scripts/purge/build-usmca-purge.mjs   # writes to this directory, gitignored
usmca-transaction-purge.generated.sql
